; Where the plugin looks for nosman. The installer renames this file to
; EditorSettings.ini, so the shipped plugin carries the default while the working
; copy stays out of the repository and can be pointed at a local workspace without
; ever being committed. The path is relative to the Engine folder, so it means the
; Nodos workspace sitting next to it.
;
; Prefer Project Settings -> Nodos Link Settings for a local override: it writes to
; the engine's Saved/Config/WindowsEditor/EditorSettings.ini, which wins over this
; file and is not tracked either.
[/Script/NOSClient.NOSSettings]
NosmanPath=..\Nodos\nodos.exe
